]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record from 1951 to 2025 has September to October under 90% of normal in 40 of 75 years on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 9 grids. In 2025 that pair came in at 27% of normal on the middle, and March to April in 2025 ran 287%. So far in 2026, February to March came in at 38% of normal on the middle. Grid 16620 had its driest year in 2011 at 37% of normal.</p>"}
